STEP 1 -- "- Connect the RSTP switch and a hub/switch. - Create a loop network switch.
          - Send broadcast traffic from IXIA - Confirm Port11 of RSTP switch. RSTP Port
          Role should be set to BackUp (Loopback Disabled) and State should set to
          Discarding. - Confirm backup port should not transmit traffic"
          expected: "Backup port should not forward any packet in this state."   PASS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Method: close the lead by bringing port1.0.7 up and hold it closed only if port1.0.7 reaches
  Backup/Discarding within 20 s (the @poll gate); then read port1.0.7's spanning-tree state, take the
  port counters, send the broadcast burst from eth3 into port1.0.5, and take the counters again.

